This instance runs Claude + Shell only. There's no upstream config to hide
the OpenCode/Codex/Gemini mode buttons or the Cloudflare Tunnel button
(checked CLI flags, env vars, and the full settings schema — modes have no
toggle), so hide them with an additive CSS block in styles.css:

- welcome-screen OpenCode / Gemini / Tunnel launch buttons
- run-mode dropdown options for opencode / codex / gemini
- Codex CLI settings tab + panel
- App Settings "Remote Access" (Cloudflare Tunnel) section incl. header, and
  the experimental "Agent Teams" row

Cosmetic only (backend still supports the modes if called); additive so it
survives upstream bumps. Remove the block to restore the full UI.
---
 src/web/public/styles.css | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/web/public/styles.css b/src/web/public/styles.css
index bf0d3cd..93b766a 100644
--- a/src/web/public/styles.css
+++ b/src/web/public/styles.css
@@ -11071,3 +11071,38 @@ html[data-skin="daylight-blue"] .welcome-btn-tunnel.active:hover {
   background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #8b5cf6);
   box-shadow: 0 0 28px -4px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.5);
 }
+
+/* ============================================================================
+   Lean UI — hide runtimes/features this instance doesn't use (Claude + Shell
+   only). Purely cosmetic: the backend still supports these modes if called
+   directly, and the App Settings toggles for teams/monitor/subagents/etc. are
+   already off — this only declutters the launcher + settings. There is no
+   upstream config for the mode buttons, so they're hidden here (additive, so
+   it survives upstream bumps). Remove this block to restore the full UI.
+   ============================================================================ */
+
+/* Welcome-screen launch buttons: drop OpenCode, Gemini, and Cloudflare Tunnel
+   (keep Claude). */
+.welcome-btn-opencode,
+.welcome-btn-gemini,
+.welcome-btn-tunnel,
+/* Run-mode dropdown options for the alternate CLIs. */
+.run-mode-option[data-mode="opencode"],
+.run-mode-option[data-mode="codex"],
+.run-mode-option[data-mode="gemini"],
+/* Codex CLI settings tab + its panel. */
+.modal-tab-btn[data-tab="settings-codex"],
+#settings-codex {
+  display: none !important;
+}
+
+/* App Settings: the whole "Remote Access" (Cloudflare Tunnel) section — its
+   header (selected via the tunnel toggle that immediately follows it) plus the
+   toggle and the URL rows. And the experimental "Agent Teams" row. */
+.settings-section-header:has(+ .settings-item #appSettingsTunnelEnabled),
+.settings-item:has(#appSettingsTunnelEnabled),
+#tunnelUrlRow,
+#tunnelUploadUrlRow,
+.form-row:has(#appSettingsAgentTeams) {
+  display: none !important;
+}
